xtraction FPS experience built to push your PvP and PvE skills to their limits...\n\n*THIS EXPERIENCE IS IN ALPHA, EXPECT RESTARTS, UNFINISHED CONTENT AND GAME BREAKING BUGS*\n\nDying is part of the learning progress.\nNo matter how strong you are, expect it to happen often.\n\n- Fight against other players or defeat hardcore bosses and become the richest\n- Extract with as much gear as possible, and resell everything to traders\n- Earn reputation from multiple traders by completing tasks\n\n- This game is inspired by numerous hardcore games like Escape From Tarkov, Rust, DayZ...\n\n** PRIVATE SERVERS HAVE A SEPARATE SAVES FROM PUBLIC SERVERS **\n\n- Check our links for leaks, update logs, and upcoming content","path":"/game/115872975504419-desertstorm","slug":"115872975504419-desertstorm","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d624463067aee8534b4ad77a4127666ebc0ef3c106747b81ddd505676282d137.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-40cfe32e9925a3d7c36a5654b886eeb5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":40,"visitor":2289430,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-11T08:23:34.658Z","creator":{"name":"DesertStorm Production","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":99630341423433,"name":"BIAST.exe","desc":"{ALPHA}\nthis game is janky and sloppy, expect bugs as we are actively working on improving it!\n\nany form of support is appreciated!! ^_^ (give me money to feed my devs)\n\n/// FACE THE FUTURE, PRESERVE THE PAST ///\n\nYou've been contracted by the ROBLOX Archivists Company (RAC) to retrieve Artifacts from various Locations and points of interest. \nOne of RAC's primary goals is the research of Entities. On your mission, you'll encounter these \"Entities\", and have to avoid them by any means necessary -- as long as such \"means\" don't get in the way of your objective.\n\nControls:\nM1 - Interact\nE/Q - Pick up / Drop item \nF - Special Skill\nC - Crouch\nG - Emote\n\nEntity Controls:\nQ, E, F - Skills 1-3\nM1 - Attack\n\n(3rd game in the larry game collection)","path":"/game/99630341423433-biast-exe","slug":"99630341423433-biast-exe","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4bf23af73e6abd87a1a3043e64c1e8312a842720db4755de8c17bf5fd0c63162.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a345196fe3986087711684cabe3a4481/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":40,"visitor":16231476,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-11T02:45:32.275Z","creator":{"name":"gg gang fanclub","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12996397,"name":"Mega Fun Obby Revamped⭐2935 Stages","desc":"🚨 GAME IS FULLY REDESIGNED! Post in the forum if you come across any issues, please!\n\nPlay Roblox's longest and most fun obstacle course experience! With currently over 2900 stages, you'll be sure to have a blast playing this game for hours by yourself, or with friends and family!\n\nJoin the official community for free skips!\n\n📅 Update: 24 June, 2026\n- 5 New Stages\n- Fixed multiple stages\n\n📅 Update: 19 June, 2026\n- Redesigned Progress Bar\n- Added Fast Forward Stage Selector\n- Added Daily Challenges\n- Resized Side UI for Mobile\n- Fixed 20+ Stages\n- Added Icon Hover & Click Effect\n- Remade the Loading Screen\n- Added Background Music\n\n🔨Builder🔨 - Bloxtun\n📜 Scripter 📜 - Wrathsong ","path":"/game/12996397-mega-fun-obby-revamped-2935-stages","slug":"12996397-mega-fun-obby-revamped-2935-stages","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f0f90f897c79a321df5aa8fb8da57b3c005e1bfd9f4fed982833ad7d5770189d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e449804cd1d0caa88f8a71813b1f47b9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":40,"visitor":1164740421,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-11T17:20:43.782Z","creator":{"name":"Bloxtun's Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":18193096685,"name":"Early Dawn | BETA UPDATE","desc":"\"Fire was discovered 1.5 million years ago, shaping the future of human